      "id": "99ef68418a3e-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If X 4 + X 2 Y 2 + Y 4 = 432 and X 2 - XY + Y 2 = 18, then find the value of X 2 + Y 2 is. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X 4 + X 2 Y 2 + Y 4 = 432 &#2324;&#2352; X 2 - XY + Y 2 = 18, &#2340;&#2379; X 2 + Y 2 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If X<sup>4</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>4</sup> = 432 and X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 18, then find the value of X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> is. </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X<sup>4</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>4</sup> = 432 &#2324;&#2352; X<sup>2</sup> - XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 18, &#2340;&#2379; X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "21 21",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">21</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "15 15",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "18 18",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "27 27",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">27</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">27</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 18 .... (i)</p><p>As we know, </p><p>(X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup>) (X<sup>2</sup> + XY + Y<sup>2</sup>) = X<sup>4</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>4</sup></p><p>18 * (X<sup>2</sup> + XY + Y<sup>2)</sup> = 432 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 24 .... (ii)</p><p>Add (i) and (ii)</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = (18 + 24)/2 = 21 </p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
