      "question": "If 256a 4 + 64a 2 b 2 + 16b 4 = 864 and 16a 2 + 4b 2 - 8ab = 36, then what is the value of 4ab? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 256a 4 + 64a 2 b 2 + 16b 4 = 864 &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 16a 2 + 4b 2 - 8ab = 36, &#2340;&#2379; 4ab &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
