      "solution": "<p>16a<sup>2</sup> + 4b<sup>2</sup>  -  8ab = 36 .... (i)</p><p>256a<sup>4</sup> + 64a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 16b<sup>2</sup> = 864</p><p>(16a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 16a<sup>2</sup> * 4b<sup>2</sup> + (4b<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = 864 </p><p>(16a<sup>2</sup> + 8ab + 4b<sup>2</sup>) (16a<sup>2</sup>  -  8ab + 4b<sup>2</sup>) = 864 </p><p>(16a<sup>2</sup> + 8ab + 4b<sup>2</sup>) * 36 = 864 </p><p>16a<sup>2</sup> + 8ab + 4b<sup>2</sup> = 24 .... (ii)</p><p>Subtract (i) from (ii)</p><p>16ab = -12</p><p>4ab = -12/4 = -3 </p>",
