      "question": "If 27(X + Y) 3 - 64(X - Y) 3 = (13Y - X) (AX 2 + BY 2 + CXY), then what is the value of (A + B - C)? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 27(X + Y) 3 - 64(X - Y) 3 = (13Y - X) (AX 2 + BY 2 + CXY), &#2340;&#2379; (A + B - C) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 27(X + Y)<sup>3</sup>  -  64(X  -  Y)<sup>3</sup> = (13Y  -  X) (AX<sup>2</sup> + BY<sup>2</sup> + CXY), then what is the value of (A + B  -  C)? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 27(X + Y)<sup>3</sup> - 64(X - Y)<sup>3</sup> = (13Y - X) (AX<sup>2</sup> + BY<sup>2</sup> + CXY), &#2340;&#2379; (A + B - C) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "164 164",
