      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>27 (X + Y)<sup>3</sup>  -  64 (X  -  Y)<sup>3</sup> = (13Y  -  X) (AX<sup>2</sup> + BY<sup>2</sup> + CXY)</p><p>27 [X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup> + 3XY (X + Y)]  -  64 [X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup>  -  3XY (X  -  Y)] = 13AX<sup>2</sup>Y + 13BY<sup>3</sup> + 13CXY<sup>2</sup>  -  AX<sup>3</sup>  -  BY<sup>2</sup>X  -  CX<sup>2</sup>Y </p><p>-37X<sup>3</sup> + 91Y<sup>3</sup> + 273X<sup>2</sup>Y  -  111XY<sup>2</sup> = 13AX<sup>2</sup>Y + 13BY<sup>3</sup> + 13CXY<sup>2</sup>  -  AX<sup>3</sup>  -  BY<sup>2</sup>X  -  CX<sup>2</sup>Y</p><p>Comparing the value of A, B, and C in LHS and RHS</p><p>-AX<sup>3</sup> = -37X<sup>3</sup> </p><p>A = 37 </p><p>13BY<sup>3</sup> = 91Y<sup>3</sup></p><p>B = 7 </p><p>273X<sup>2</sup>Y = 13AX<sup>2</sup>Y  -  CX<sup>2</sup>Y </p><p>273 = 13A  -  C </p><p>C = 208 </p><p>A + B  -  C = 37 + 7  -  208 = -164</p>",
