      "solution": "<p>(X  -  3Y)<sup>2</sup> = X<sup>2</sup> + 9Y<sup>2</sup>  -  6XY </p><p>49 = 103  -  6XY </p><p>XY = 9 </p><p>X<sup>3</sup>  -  27Y<sup>3</sup> = X<sup>3</sup>  -  (3Y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>X<sup>3</sup>  -  (3Y)<sup>3</sup> = (X  -  3Y) (X<sup>2</sup> + 3XY + 9Y<sup>2</sup>) </p><p>= 7 * (103 + 3 * 9) </p><p>= 910</p>",
