    {
      "id": "99ef68418a3e-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "If (6X + Y) 3 - (X - 6Y) 3 = (5X + 7Y) (AX 2 + CXY + BY 2 ), then what is the value of A + 2B + C? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (6X + Y) 3 - (X - 6Y) 3 = (5X + 7Y) (AX 2 + CXY + BY 2 ) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; A + 2B + C &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (6X + Y)<sup>3</sup>  -  (X  -  6Y)<sup>3</sup> = (5X + 7Y) (AX<sup>2</sup> + CXY + BY<sup>2</sup>), then what is the value of A + 2B + C? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (6X + Y)<sup>3</sup>  -  (X  -  6Y)<sup>3</sup> = (5X + 7Y) (AX<sup>2</sup> + CXY + BY<sup>2</sup>) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; A + 2B + C &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "70 70",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">70</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">70</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "65 65",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">65</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">65</span>"
