        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "75 75",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">75</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">75</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "80 80",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">80</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">80</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>(6X + Y)<sup>3</sup>  -  (X  -  6Y)<sup>3</sup> = (6X + Y  -  X + 6Y) [(6X + Y)<sup>2</sup> + (X  -  6Y)<sup>2</sup> + (6X + Y) (X  -  6Y)] </p><p>= (5X + 7Y) [36X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> + 12XY + X<sup>2</sup> + 36Y<sup>2</sup>  -  12XY + 6X<sup>2</sup>  -  36XY + XY  -  6Y<sup>2</sup>] </p><p>= (5X + 7Y) [43X<sup>2</sup> + 31Y<sup>2</sup>  -  35XY] </p><p>So, A = 43 </p><p>B = 31 </p><p>C = -35 </p><p>A + 2B + C </p><p>=&gt; 43 + 2 * 31  -  35 </p><p>=&gt; 70 </p>",
