      "question": "For what positive values of K do the following pair of linear equations have infinitely many solutions? Kx + 9y - (K - 9) = 0 36x + Ky - K = 0 K &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2375;&#2325; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;? Kx + 9y - (K - 9) = 0 36x + Ky - K = 0",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what positive values of K do the following pair of linear equations have infinitely many solutions? </p><p>Kx + 9y  -  (K  -  9) = 0 </p><p>36x + Ky - K = 0 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>K &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2375;&#2325; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p>Kx + 9y - (K - 9) = 0 </p><p>36x + Ky - K = 0 </p></span>",
      "options": [
