      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>A<sub>1</sub>x + B<sub>1</sub>y + C<sub>1</sub> = 0 .. (i)</p><p>A<sub>2</sub>x + B<sub>2</sub>Y + C<sub>2</sub> = 0 ... (ii)</p><p>If eq 1 and 2 have infinite solutions then, </p><p>A<sub>1</sub>/A<sub>2</sub> = B<sub>1</sub>/B<sub>2</sub> = C<sub>1</sub>/C<sub>2</sub> (Constant) </p><p>Kx + 9y  -  (K  -  9) = 0 </p><p>36x + Ky - K = 0 </p><p>A<sub>1</sub> = K, B<sub>1</sub> = 9, C<sub>1</sub> =  -  K + 9 ... (iii)</p><p>A<sub>2</sub> = 36, B<sub>2</sub> = K, C<sub>2</sub> = -K ... (iv)</p><p>K/36 = 9/K </p><p>K = 18, -18</p><p>9/K = (-K + 9)/-K </p><p>9 = K  -  9</p><p>K = 18</p>",
