      "number": 17,
      "question": "For what positive values of K do the following pair of linear equations have infinitely many solutions? Kx + 4y - (K - 4) = 0 16x + Ky - K = 0 K &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2375;&#2325; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;? Kx + 4y - (K - 4) = 0 16x + Ky - K = 0",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what positive values of K do the following pair of linear equations have infinitely many solutions? </p><p>Kx + 4y  -  (K  -  4) = 0 </p><p>16x + Ky - K = 0 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>K &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2375;&#2325; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p>Kx + 4y - (K - 4) = 0 </p><p>16x + Ky - K = 0 </p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8 8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "6 6",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-4 -4",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-12 -12",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-12</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>A<sub>1</sub>x + B<sub>1</sub>y + C<sub>1</sub> = 0 .. (i)</p><p>A<sub>2</sub>x + B<sub>2</sub>Y + C<sub>2</sub> = 0 ... (ii)</p><p>If eq 1 and 2 have infinite solutions then, </p><p>A<sub>1</sub>/A<sub>2</sub> = B<sub>1</sub>/B<sub>2</sub> = C<sub>1</sub>/C<sub>2</sub> (Constant) </p><p>Kx + 4y  -  (K  -  4) = 0 </p><p>16x + Ky - K = 0 </p><p>A<sub>1</sub> = K, B<sub>1</sub> = 4, C<sub>1</sub> =  -  K + 4 ... (iii)</p><p>A<sub>2</sub> = 16, B<sub>2</sub> = K, C<sub>2</sub> = -K ... (iv)</p><p>K/16 = 4/K </p><p>K = 8, -8</p><p>4/K = (-K + 4)/-K </p><p>4 = K  -  4 </p><p>K = 8 </p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
