      "question": "x, y are two such positive numbers such that x > y. If x 4 + y 4 = 1106 and xy = 13, then 2x + 3y = ? x, y &#2342;&#2379; &#2320;&#2360;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; x > y. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x 4 + y 4 = 1106 &#2324;&#2352; xy = 13, &#2340;&#2379; 2x + 3y = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>x, y are two such positive numbers such that x &gt; y. If x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup> = 1106 and xy = 13, then 2x + 3y = ? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>x, y &#2342;&#2379; &#2320;&#2360;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; x &gt; y. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup> = 1106 &#2324;&#2352; xy = 13, &#2340;&#2379; 2x + 3y = ? </p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "20 + &radic;3 20 + &radic;3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">20 + &radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">20 + &radic;3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "12 - &radic;3 12 - &radic;3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">12 - &radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12 - &radic;3</span>"
        },
        {
