          "text": "12 + &radic;3 12 + &radic;3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">12 + &radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12 + &radic;3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "20 - &radic;3 20 - &radic;3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">20 - &radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">20 - &radic;3</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>X<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup> = 932</p><p>(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> = 1106 + 2x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup></p><p>(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = 1106 + 2 * 13<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 38 </p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy = 38 + 2xy </p><p>(x + y)<sup>2</sup> = 38 + 2 * 13</p><p>x + y = 8 ...(i)</p><p>(x  -  y)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy </p><p>= 12 </p><p>x  -  y = 2&radic;3 ... (ii)</p><p>From (i) and (ii)</p><p>x = 4 + &radic;3 </p><p>y = 4 - &radic;3 </p><p>So, 2&radic;x + 3y = 20 - &radic;3 </p>",
